{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01483","headline":"舞曲歌辞 白鸠辞 · 李白","name":"舞曲歌辞 白鸠辞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"铿鸣钟，考朗鼓。\n歌白鸠，引拂舞。\n白鸠之白谁与邻，霜衣雪襟诚可珍。\n含哺七子能平均，食不咽，性安驯。\n首农政，鸣阳春。\n天子刻玉杖，镂形赐耆人。\n白鹭亦白非纯真，外洁其色心匪仁。\n阙五德，无司晨。\n胡爲啄我葭下之紫鳞，鹰鸇鵰鹗，贪而好杀。\n凤皇虽大圣，不愿以爲臣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01483.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01483","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}